      "questionText": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"347\"><strong>Drag and drop to complete the passage.</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"347\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"/images/exams/surgeon_career_20224f58.png\" alt width=\"300\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"347\">If you want to become a doctor or surgeon, you need to start with the right education. Many people begin by enrolling in a <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.1</label><input id='fbo-911048-0' class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='0' name='fbo-911048-0' type='text' size='20' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-911048-0' /></span></strong>, where they learn about the human body and how to treat different diseases. After finishing their basic studies, some choose to join <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.2</label><input id='fbo-911048-1' class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='1' name='fbo-911048-1' type='text' size='19' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-911048-1' /></span></strong> that focus on specific skills.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"349\" data-end=\"639\">Surgeons work with a <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.3</label><input id='fbo-911048-2' class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='2' name='fbo-911048-2' type='text' size='15' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-911048-2' /></span></strong>. It includes doctors, nurses, and other specialists who help during surgeries. Good <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.4</label><input id='fbo-911048-3' class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='3' name='fbo-911048-3' type='text' size='22' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-911048-3' /></span></strong>&nbsp;is important because surgeons need to carefully control their tools while performing delicate operations.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"641\" data-end=\"860\" data-is-last-node data-is-only-node>Choosing a career in medicine is a big decision, but with the right training and skills, you can make a difference in people&#8217;s lives. It&#8217;s a challenging but rewarding job that requires a lot of dedication and hard work.</p>",
